# Mixture of Experts (MoE) Learning Path

Welcome! This repository is a **4-week structured learning journey** into Mixture of Experts (MoE) — an architecture-level innovation in AI that enables large models to scale efficiently.

The repo combines:
- **Foundational knowledge** of AI systems (so you know where MoE fits),
- **Hands-on tutorials** (fast.ai style, code-first learning),
- **Structured modules** (DeepLearning.AI style, with concepts + exercises),
- **Research insights** from papers and open-source projects.

